cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  This repository contains the analysis code and reproduction materials for
  the dioscRi manuscript. If you use this code or its outputs, please cite
  the manuscript.
type: software
title: "dioscRi manuscript: analysis code and reproduction materials"
abstract: >-
  Analysis notebooks, revision scripts, response materials, and supplementary
  figures for the manuscript "dioscRi enables transferable prediction of
  clinical outcomes in multi-parameter cytometry data". Companion repository
  to the dioscRi R package (https://github.com/ecool50/dioscRi).
